[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12200200_03_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12200200_03_0010","text":"……嗯，不错哦小糸酱\n能再给我一个比现在好百分之十的笑容吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12200200_03_0020","text":"是、是的……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12200200_03_0006","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12200200_03_0030","text":"…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12200200_03_0040","text":"（加油，小糸……！）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12200200_03_0005","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12200200_03_0050","text":"……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12200200_03_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12200200_03_0060","text":"你驾驭得很好\n得好好拍几张才行呢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12200200_03_0070","text":"……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12200200_03_0002","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12200200_03_0080","text":"……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12200200_03_0003","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12200200_03_0004","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12200200_03_0090","text":"辛苦了，小糸\n最后一张拍得很棒"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12200200_03_0100","text":"好、好的……！\n嘿嘿……"}]
